#. Tag: title
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kded4</command> is responsible for creating the sycoca file, i.e. "
"the binary cache of servicetypes, mimetypes, and services for a particular "
"user."
msgstr ""
"<command>kded4</command> je odgovoran za stvaranje sycoca fajla, odnosno "
"binarni keš servicetypes, mimetypes i usluge za pojedinog korisnika."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It monitors the directories containing .desktop files. When a file is added/"
"removed, it waits 5 seconds (in case of a series of updates), and then "
"launches <command>kbuildsycoca4</command> to update the sycoca."
msgstr ""
"Ona nadgleda direktorije koji sadrže .desktop fajlove. Kada je datoteka "
"dodana / uklonjena, čeka 5 sekundi (u slučaju niza ažuriranja), a zatim "
"pokreće <command>kbuildsycoca4</command>   da biste ažurirali sycoca."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It checks newly installed update files, i.e. the *.upd files used to update "
"configuration files of users when the configuration file formats changes. "
"<command>kconf_update</command> is launched to do the updates."
msgstr ""
"Provjerava azuriranja novo instaliranih datoteka, odnosno * .upd fajlove "
"koristi za ažuriranje konfiguracijske datoteke korisnika kada se mijenja "
"format konfiguracijske datoteke. <command>kconf_update</command>  je "
"pokrenuta da radi ažuriranja."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the hostname changes, it will make the necessary changes to the KDE "
"environment and X-server to allow continued proper operation, launching "
"<command>kdontchangethehostname</command> to do the changes."
msgstr ""
"Kada se promjeni hostname, to će učiniti potrebne promjene u KDE okruženje i "
"X-poslužitelju kako bi se omogućio nastavak pravilanog rada, "
"pokretanje<command>kdontchangethehostname</command>da to promjeni."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Those tasks are also performed always at kded4 start to ensure that the user "
"configuration is up to date."
msgstr ""
"Ti zadaci su također obavljaju uvijek na kded4 i počinju  kako bi se "
"osiguralo da je azurirana korisnicka konfiguracija."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is also responsible for launching the on-demand kded4 modules and init "
"enabled kded4 modules like:"
msgstr ""
"Također je odgovoran za pokretanje  kded4 modula i omogućavanje "
"inicijalizacije  kded4 modula kao što su:"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Konqueror Browser Preloader"
msgstr "Učitavač Konqueror Preglednika"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reduces Konqueror startup time."
msgstr "Smanjuje Konqueror vrijeme pokretanja."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Directory Watcher"
msgstr "Pratilac direktorija"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Monitors directories for changes."
msgstr "Prati direktorije na promjene."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hardware Detection"
msgstr "Hardverska detekcija"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Provides a user interface for hardware events."
msgstr "Pruža korisnički interfejs za hardver događaje."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "SSL Certificate Policy"
msgstr "Pravila SSL certifikata"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Provides the user configured SSL certificate policy to applications."
msgstr "Pruža korisniku konfiguriran SSL certifikat politike za aplikacije."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija mrežnog Proxy"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic proxy configuration."
msgstr "Automatska proxy konfiguracija."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password Caching"
msgstr "Keširanje lozinki"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Temporary password caching, for example: so that a webpage with HTTP "
"authentication doesn't ask for your password for every link and every image "
"in the page. These passwords are forgotten when exiting KDE (unlike "
"<command>KWallet</command>)"
msgstr ""
"Privremena caching lozinka, na primjer, kako bi web stranice sa HTTP  za "
"potvrdu identiteta ne traze lozinku za svaki link  i svaku sliku na "
"stranici. Pasvordi se zaboravljaju kad se izađe iz KDE  (za razliku od  "
"<command>KWallet</command>)"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sound Policy"
msgstr "Pravila zvuka"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Provides the sound system policy to applications."
msgstr "Obezbjeđuje sistem zvuka aplikacijama."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Favicons"
msgstr "Favikone"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stores website icons."
msgstr "Čuva ikone web stranica."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje displejom"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manages displays and video outputs."
msgstr "Upravlja diplejima i video izlazima."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cookie jar"
msgstr "Cookie jar"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stores network cookies."
msgstr "Čuva mrežne kolačiće."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network Watcher"
msgstr "Mrezni posmatrac"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keeps track of the network and updates directory listings of the "
"<application>network:/</application> KIO slave."
msgstr ""
"Vodi i evidenciju o mrežama i ažurira direktorij oglasa od <application> "
"mreže: / </application> KIO slave."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Subversion Module"
msgstr "Modul sistema subversion"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Provides various subversion actions to filemanager and other software."
msgstr "Pruža razne subverzije akcije za menadzer fajlova  i drugi softver."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network Status"
msgstr "Mrežni status"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tracks status of network interfaces and provides notifications for "
"applications using the network."
msgstr ""
"Prati status mreže interfejsa i pruža obavijesti za aplikacije koje koriste "
"mrežu."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Write Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon pisanja"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Watches the messages from local users sent with <replaceable>write</"
"replaceable>(1) or <replaceable>wall</replaceable>(1)."
