#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Input Actions service performing configured actions on key presses."
msgstr ""
"Servis ulaznih akvija obavlja usluge konfigurisanih akcija  koje su unesene."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
